WEBVTT

00:01:57.702 --> 00:02:00.546
It must also consider

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:07.111
its impacts on both the environment
and on the dignity of people.

00:02:09.603 --> 00:02:14.094
We could say that the economy

00:02:14.118 --> 00:02:17.711
should be creative

00:02:17.735 --> 00:02:21.843
in itself and in its methods,

00:02:21.867 --> 00:02:23.836
in the way it acts.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:25.213
Creativity.

00:02:25.859 --> 00:02:29.695
I would like to invite you
to go on a journey together.